From: Sanne Raymaekers <sanne.raymaekers@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 19:39:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] go.mod: update osbuild/images to 61b16700

This enables bootupd metadata generation for edge-commits, including for
9.6+ images.
---
 go.mod                                        |  2 +-
 go.sum                                        |  4 +--
 .../data/distrodefs/rhel-9/imagetypes.yaml    | 27 +++++++++++++--
 .../images/data/repositories/fedora-45.json   | 34 -------------------
 vendor/modules.txt                            |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 vendor/github.com/osbuild/images/data/repositories/fedora-45.json

